WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.750
She never snapped at the friend

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.950
who laughed at her

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.450
in front of 12 people.

4
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.900
She just stopped replying,

5
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.100
and 8 months later

6
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:08.600
she still can't say why.

7
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.700
It was a birthday dinner,

8
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.200
and her friend joked about

9
00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.400
her failed job interview.

10
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.550
Everyone laughed,

11
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.750
so she laughed too,

12
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.550
gripping her fork under the table.

13
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.600
That night she typed three replies,

14
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:20.500
deleted all three,

15
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.000
and put her phone face-down.

16
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.100
She wasn't ignoring her friend.

17
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.550
She was ignoring herself.

18
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.050
In week one,

19
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.550
she muted the group chat

20
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.350
and told herself it was fine.

21
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:31.500
By month two,

22
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.700
she'd stopped answering anyone

23
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.200
who made her feel small.

24
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.350
By month five,

25
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.150
she was saying "I don't care"

26
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.650
about things she cared about.

27
00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.800
By month eight,

28
00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.000
40 texts sat unread

29
00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.200
and she felt nothing.

30
00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:43.700
Silence isn't peace.

31
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:44.900
It's an unsent message

32
00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.400
that gets heavier every week.

33
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.150
Next time, say it small:

34
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.350
"That one hurt me."

35
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.250
Then breathe.

36
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:51.750
I'm Dimples.

37
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.850
I talk about the things we feel

38
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.350
but never say out loud.

39
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.250
Follow for more.
